{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>And you shall keep My charge.</b> To warn the court concerning this (ibid.)." "<b>And you shall not defile yourselves through them, I am YHWH your Elohim.</b> That is, if you defile yourselves — I am not your Elohim, and you are disqualified from following Me, and what benefit do I have from you, and you are liable to destruction? Therefore it says, ״I am YHWH your Elohim״ (ibid.)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:07:01.011598490Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}